flowchart TD
    input([User Input])

    memory[1. Memory Detection]
    classifier[2. Intent Classification]
    selector[3. Provider Selection]
    fallback[4. Fallback Manager]
    formatter[5. Response Formatter]

    memory_store[(Temporary Session Memory)]
    local_math[Local Math Engine]
    ollama[(Ollama)]
    groq[(Groq)]
    hf[(Hugging Face)]
    wiki[(Wikipedia)]
    weather[(Open-Meteo)]
    maps[(OpenStreetMap)]
    location[Location Service]

    output([Display + Speech Response])

    input --> memory
    memory -->|Personal memory request| memory_store
    memory_store --> formatter

    memory -->|Non-memory request| classifier
    classifier --> selector
    selector --> fallback

    fallback -->|Mathematics| local_math
    fallback -->|Conversation / fallback| ollama
    fallback -->|Programming / reasoning| groq
    fallback -->|Translation| hf
    fallback -->|Knowledge| wiki
    fallback -->|Weather| weather
    fallback -->|Maps| maps

    weather -->|Current location needed| location
    location --> weather

    local_math --> formatter
    ollama --> formatter
    groq --> formatter
    hf --> formatter
    wiki --> formatter
    weather --> formatter
    maps --> formatter

    formatter -->|Metadata for display| output
    formatter -->|Assistant message for TTS| output
